    "text": {
     "en": "A seed needs water, air and suitable warmth to germinate. A root grows first, then the shoot with leaves.\nPlants grow taller, move parts such as leaves towards light and flowers open and close.\nThe life cycle of a plant: seed, seedling, young plant, adult plant with flowers, fruit and new seeds."
